{
  "name": "Alert Slack & Google Sheets on Newly Opened US Dental & Medical Clinic Owners (CMS NPI-2)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🦷 Newly Opened US Dental & Medical Clinic Owner Phone Engine (CMS NPI-2)\n**Why agencies love NPI-2 over Google Maps scrapers:**\nGoogle Maps gives you the receptionist desk phone. The federal **CMS NPPES NPI-2 Registry** legally requires every new corporate clinic to register its **Authorized Official (Owner / President / Managing Partner)** and their **direct phone number**.\nThis workflow calls PipeForge's zero-proxy **CMS NPI-2 Clinic Owner Engine** (`$3.50 / 1,000 clinics`), sorts newest-first (2024–2026 openings), deduplicates multi-location DSOs by owner phone, and routes newly opened practices to Slack + Google Sheets.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "npi-note-overview-0001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### ⚙️ 60-Second Setup (Header Auth)\n1. Create a **Header Auth** credential in n8n:\n   - Header Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN`\n2. Attach it to **Fetch Newly Opened CMS NPI-2 Clinics**.\n3. Connect **Google Sheets** (`YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`) and **Slack** (`YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID`).\n4. Customize `states` (`[\"TX\", \"FL\", \"CA\"]`) and `taxonomyDescriptions` (`[\"Dentist\", \"Dermatology\", \"Chiropractor\"]`).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "npi-note-setup-0002",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🎯 Fresh Opening Detection\n- **TRUE branch (`NEW_CLINIC`):** Newly opened practices (2025–2026) trigger an immediate Slack alert for medical/dental marketing agencies, EHR/VoIP reps, or equipment brokers.\n- **FALSE branch:** Established clinics still log cleanly into Google Sheets with Authorized Official contact info.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "npi-note-routing-0003",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Routing Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        660
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "npi-node-trigger-0001",
      "name": "Weekly Monday 9AM EST Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/pipeforge~us-cms-npi2-clinic-owner-phone-leads/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"states\": [\"TX\", \"FL\"],\n  \"taxonomyDescriptions\": [\"Dentist\", \"Dermatology\"],\n  \"city\": \"\",\n  \"limit\": 25,\n  \"minEnumerationYear\": 2024,\n  \"deduplicateByPhone\": true,\n  \"maxPagesPerQuery\": 3\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "npi-node-apify-0002",
      "name": "Fetch Newly Opened CMS NPI-2 Clinics",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-new-clinic-opening",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.signal_priority }}",
              "rightValue": "NEW",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "npi-node-if-0003",
      "name": "Filter Newly Opened Clinics",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        700,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "=:hospital: *NEWLY OPENED US CLINIC DETECTED ({{ $json.signal_priority }})*\n*Clinic:* {{ $json.organization_name }} (`NPI-2: {{ $json.npi_number }}`)\n*Specialty:* {{ $json.primary_taxonomy }} | *Opened:* {{ $json.enumeration_date }}\n*Authorized Official (Owner):* {{ $json.official_full_name }} ({{ $json.official_title }})\n*Owner Direct Phone:* `{{ $json.official_direct_phone }}` | *Front Desk:* `{{ $json.practice_phone }}`\n*Location:* {{ $json.street_address }}, {{ $json.city }}, {{ $json.state }} {{ $json.zip_code }}\n*Registry:* {{ $json.npi_registry_url }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "npi-node-slack-0004",
      "name": "Alert Sales Team on Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "CMS_NPI2_Clinic_Owners",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "signal_priority": "={{ $json.signal_priority }}",
            "npi_number": "={{ $json.npi_number }}",
            "organization_name": "={{ $json.organization_name }}",
            "dba_other_name": "={{ $json.dba_other_name }}",
            "primary_taxonomy": "={{ $json.primary_taxonomy }}",
            "enumeration_date": "={{ $json.enumeration_date }}",
            "official_full_name": "={{ $json.official_full_name }}",
            "official_title": "={{ $json.official_title }}",
            "official_direct_phone": "={{ $json.official_direct_phone }}",
            "practice_phone": "={{ $json.practice_phone }}",
            "city": "={{ $json.city }}",
            "state": "={{ $json.state }}",
            "npi_registry_url": "={{ $json.npi_registry_url }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "npi-node-sheets-0005",
      "name": "Log All Verified Clinic Owners to Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        980,
        520
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Weekly Monday 9AM EST Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Newly Opened CMS NPI-2 Clinics",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Newly Opened CMS NPI-2 Clinics": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter Newly Opened Clinics",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Newly Opened Clinics": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert Sales Team on Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Log All Verified Clinic Owners to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Log All Verified Clinic Owners to Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
